{"page":20023,"part":1,"text":"譬成章第十二\n\n\n譬成章第十二\n\n凡学书之道，有多种焉。初业书要类乎本，缓笔定其形势，忙则失其规矩。若拟目前要急之用，厥理难成，但取形质快健，手腕轻便，方圆大小各不相犯。莫以字小易，而忙行笔势；莫以字大难，而慢展毫头。如是则筋骨不等，生死相混。倘一点失所，若美人之病一目；一国失节，如壮士之折一肱。予《乐毅论》一本，书为家宝，学此得成，自外咸就，勿以难学而自惰焉。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20023,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"40b55f6148b1f16788ae4ce51854eaf1e18e594510c527a04c60dcde0802ef61","textSha256":"40b55f6148b1f16788ae4ce51854eaf1e18e594510c527a04c60dcde0802ef61","fileSha256":"40b55f6148b1f16788ae4ce51854eaf1e18e594510c527a04c60dcde0802ef61","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20023-work-021.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"笔势论十二章 并序 · 譬成章第十二","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/7wKzKkqEtPksjBUcmK1gfa","originalPages":[48],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":7,"sourceTextSha256":"5d39548ead96dcc091387d6bc19f89ceb9665b42cf269993668e6e3ccda98400","id":"local-48-17-30","page_id":48,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":17,"rawEnd":30,"reviewedTextSha256":"33ae5751c34a81fc49d6b24364226f59fb2b57bbbcf456b176eba1e84f69b658","displayUnitOrigins":[[23,24],[24,25],[25,26],[26,27],[27,28],[28,29],[29,30]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":48,"part":1,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"肖源","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T07:55:49.558Z","revision":"33ae5751c34a81fc49d6b24364226f59fb2b57bbbcf456b176eba1e84f69b658","textSha256":"33ae5751c34a81fc49d6b24364226f59fb2b57bbbcf456b176eba1e84f69b658","fileSha256":"79106ac65424604a53ca79186ecc2bad7dbbdc92135f4d626b3d9b63cebb6e55","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":9